WEBVTT - Project Nova Intro

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Humanity is growing colder.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Across the system, heat cores and fusion cores are sought after.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
A core can keep a ship moving. Or a station alive.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Every delivery has a destination. Every choice has a cost.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Nova-Lead, your flight is ready.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Fly the route. Watch your contacts. Bring the cargo home.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Out here, what you take matters. So does what you leave.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Project Nova. Your next choice is ahead.
